# Project:     Juniper / juniper-deploy
# Author:      Paul Calnon
# Created:     2026-09-16
# License:     MIT License
#
# Docker's build context does NOT honour .gitignore. This file is the only
# thing that keeps the context clean, and `Dockerfile.test` is published to a
# PUBLIC GHCR package, so anything reachable here is one `COPY` away from
# being world-readable.
#
# Dockerfile.test copies an explicit ALLOWLIST of paths rather than `COPY . .`,
# so the two mechanisms are independent: the allowlist cannot leak a file
# nobody named, and this denylist protects any future COPY that is broader
# than its author intended. Keep both.

# ── Credentials. secrets/ holds eight live files (API keys, the Grafana admin
#    password, an SMTP password). They are gitignored, which Docker ignores. ──
secrets/
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.observability

# ── Local / untracked state that has no business in an image ──
.git/
.git*
!.gitignore
logs/
data/
backups/
backup/
reports/
temp/
resources/
images/

# ── Build and test detritus ──
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
